        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಪರಿಸರ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪರಿಸರ — parisara — \"the environment; surroundings\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪ್ಲಾಸ್ಟಿಕ್ ಪರಿಸರಕ್ಕೆ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದಲ್ಲ. plāsṭik parisarakke oḷḷeyadalla. Plastic is not good for the environment."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪರಿಸರ (parisara) ದಿನ, environment day."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪರಿಸರ (parisara) is borrowed from Sanskrit parisara, \"adjacent, lying around\" (Monier-Williams); modern Kannada uses it for the environment."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
