          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಾಲಿನ್ಯ — mālinya — \"pollution\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಗರದಲ್ಲಿ ವಾಹನಗಳಿಂದ ಗಾಳಿಯ ಮಾಲಿನ್ಯ ಹೆಚ್ಚಾಗಿದೆ. nagaradalli vāhanagaḷinda gāḷiya mālinya heccāgide. In the city air pollution from vehicles has gone up."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಾಯು ಮಾಲಿನ್ಯ (mālinya), air pollution; ಜಲ ಮಾಲಿನ್ಯ (mālinya), water pollution."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಾಲಿನ್ಯ (mālinya) is borrowed from Sanskrit mālinya, \"foulness, dirtiness, impurity\" (Monier-Williams), from malina, \"dirty\"."
            }
          ]
        },
